  progressbar: {fileID: 592347475}
  dialogue1:
  - Welcome to battle mode! This is where you can fix errors that occur within softwares.
  - Since it seems that this is your first time, let's do a tutorial first.
  - 'Try moving left and right across the slots. '
  name: ???
  dialogue2:
  - 'You will be assigned an element, either 1 or 0. '
  - Also, elements will come down towards you from above...you job is to only touch
    elements that match yourself!
  - To fix the error, you will have to finish the process without your health dropping
    to zero, and also complete the mission that is written on your right.
  dialogue3:
  - Sometimes, your assigned element will change. You don't know when the change
    will come, so keep an eye out for that!
  - Now, try fixing the error!
  dialogue4:
  - Alright! Now that this is over, the screen will switch over to the actual error
    that you must fix.
  - 'Good luck! '
  effects: 030000000300000003000000
